# Localization
#
# This report of untranslated strings (l10n.yaml: untranslated-messages-file)
# is regenerated on every build, so it is not tracked.
l10n_missing.txt
#
# NOTE: the generated Dart in lib/l10n/ (app_localizations*.dart) is
# deliberately COMMITTED, unlike most generated code. Verified on Flutter
# 3.27.4: neither `flutter pub get` nor `flutter analyze` nor `flutter build`
# regenerates these files when they are absent — a fresh clone fails to
# compile with 44 "Undefined name 'AppLocalizations'" errors. They are small
# and only change when app_en.arb changes, so tracking them is the price of a
# clone that just works.
# Do not add lib/l10n/app_localizations*.dart here.
